        "client_msg_id": "3fb316d8-6479-4334-ba11-77a7ce9da016",
        "text": "Other than Winds and local Chinese language newspaper (SingTao and World Journal), I have another idea of pitching it to a not very local news outlet - <https:\/\/theinitium.com\/zh-hans|Initium> Media, a Chinese language outlet for younger Chinese diaspora folks like me.\nI know some people in SingTao, World Journal (local), Initium Media (International) and can facilitate those connection if that helps. I still hope we can get in some English language news first. (That's why the publishing date is not clear)",
